  "description": "<p>Hello, Im Champion Of Light and this addon is an expansion of my camos which got into the mod “Weapon Camo and Stickers’. This addon might be not big as I wanted, but it adds more variety of customization for your weapon and serves for me as a first attempt to post something here.</p>\n<p>Later Ill try to post screenshots</p>\n<p>Mod Includes:</p>\n<p>8 new camos</p>\n<p>5 new masks like Berezka, tree sticks and etc</p>\n<p>13 new stickers which is based on ancient nordic, paganic symbols and runes\nAll things that were added are trying to be in military style without any really bright stuff</p>\n<p>Ak with bunch of runes and symbols\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/Opeshek/ChampionsOfLight-Bunch-of-Runes/blob/main/Ak_with_Stickers.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://github.com/Opeshek/ChampionsOfLight-Bunch-of-Runes/blob/main/Ak_with_Stickers.png</a></p>\n<p>Ak covered in Berezka mask and runes\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/Opeshek/ChampionsOfLight-Bunch-of-Runes/blob/main/AK_Berezka_Camo%2Brunes.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://github.com/Opeshek/ChampionsOfLight-Bunch-of-Runes/blob/main/AK_Berezka_Camo%2Brunes.png</a></p>\n<p>M4 with tree sticks pattern\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/Opeshek/ChampionsOfLight-Bunch-of-Runes/blob/main/M4_Tree_Stics_Mask.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://github.com/Opeshek/ChampionsOfLight-Bunch-of-Runes/blob/main/M4_Tree_Stics_Mask.png</a></p>\n",
